COMMENT ON VIEW api.worker_job_domain_refs IS 'Service-role projection from canonical worker_jobs to retained non-legacy domain artifact/cache/history/coordinator rows. Legacy job tables are intentionally excluded so they can be retired with DROP RESTRICT after runtime cutover.';


